WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.616
Mr. Smith: Danny, don’t bother the other students.

2
00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:21.612
Tina: You’re going to get into trouble.

3
00:00:21.613 --> 00:00:24.973
Danny: I need to look at you more closely.

4
00:00:24.974 --> 00:00:27.329
Tina: What are you talking about?

5
00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.972
Danny: Come here and look! See?

6
00:00:32.973 --> 00:00:35.347
Tina: That’s pretty good, Danny.

7
00:00:35.348 --> 00:00:38.502
Danny: Yeah, but I’m missing something.

8
00:00:38.503 --> 00:00:43.974
Brad: She’s right. That looks good, Danny.

9
00:00:43.975 --> 00:00:46.782
Dave: Hey! Look at this!

10
00:00:46.783 --> 00:00:52.295
Chuck: Well, well, well. Isn’t this cute!

11
00:00:52.296 --> 00:00:56.187
Danny: Just leave me alone.

12
00:00:56.188 --> 00:00:59.924
Chuck: Aww. He likes the girl!

13
00:00:59.925 --> 00:01:02.479
Dave: He’s in love with her.

14
00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:07.360
Chuck: Are you guys going to get married?

15
00:01:07.361 --> 00:01:10.899
Danny: Give me that!

16
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:14.066
Dave: He wants his girlfriend back.

17
00:01:14.067 --> 00:01:17.152
Danny: She’s not my girlfriend!

18
00:01:17.153 --> 00:01:21.253
Stop! You’re squishing my model!

19
00:01:21.254 --> 00:01:24.507
Tina: Why don’t you leave him alone?

20
00:01:24.508 --> 00:01:26.869
Chuck: Isn’t that sweet?

21
00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.864
She's standing up for her boyfriend.

22
00:01:29.865 --> 00:01:33.040
Tina: You don’t want to make me angry.

23
00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:36.720
Dave: Why? What’s going to happen?

24
00:01:36.721 --> 00:01:42.722
Tina: Have you forgotten what happened last week?

25
00:01:42.723 --> 00:01:45.768
Chuck: Here’s your little doll back!

26
00:01:45.769 --> 00:01:49.521
Dave: You’re lucky that your girlfriend is strong.

27
00:01:49.522 --> 00:01:53.468
Danny: SHE’S NOT MY GIRLFRIEND!

28
00:01:53.469 --> 00:01:56.791
Tina: Danny, quiet.

29
00:01:56.792 --> 00:01:58.749
Mr. Smith: What’s going on here?

30
00:01:58.750 --> 00:02:00.859
Why are you yelling, Danny?

31
00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:04.114
Danny: These guys are driving me crazy!

32
00:02:04.115 --> 00:02:07.171
Mr. Smith: Danny, I think you’re driving me crazy.

33
00:02:07.172 --> 00:02:09.111
Tina: No, really, Mr. Smith.

34
00:02:09.112 --> 00:02:13.314
These boys were picking on Danny.

35
00:02:13.315 --> 00:02:15.356
Mr. Smith: Is that true, boys?

36
00:02:15.357 --> 00:02:17.435
Dave: No, Mr. Smith.

37
00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:20.514
Chuck: We just like his clay models.

38
00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:24.623
Dave: Yeah. We think they’re really good.

39
00:02:24.624 --> 00:02:27.586
Mr. Smith: Danny? What do you have to say?

40
00:02:27.587 --> 00:02:35.052
Danny: They . . . are . . . big . . . stinking . . . LIARS!

41
00:02:35.053 --> 00:02:37.634
Mr. Smith: Danny, that’s enough!

42
00:02:37.635 --> 00:02:42.204
Tina: Danny, calm down.

43
00:02:42.205 --> 00:02:44.025
Brad: Mr. Smith?

44
00:02:44.026 --> 00:02:45.550
Mr. Smith: Yes, Brad.

45
00:02:45.551 --> 00:02:48.586
Brad: I can prove that Danny is innocent.

46
00:02:48.587 --> 00:02:55.242
Mr. Smith: Brad, please return to your desk.

47
00:02:55.243 --> 00:02:57.600
Everybody, back to your desks.

48
00:02:57.601 --> 00:02:59.934
Danny: But Mr. Smith. . .

49
00:02:59.935 --> 00:03:01.237
Mr. Smith: That’s enough, Danny.

50
00:03:01.238 --> 00:03:05.781
We will not be using clay anymore today!
